{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Review-plan finding verified and the plan revised (2026-11-21 PST): ruff PLW1514 only flags calls on receivers it can type as pathlib.Path. An AST scan at 863abe7cd19 finds 12 locale-default text I/O sites in src/rebar (10 files), 15 in scripts (7 files) and 2228 in tests (542 files), where PLW1514 reports 0, 0 and 229. The src sites are product defects on Windows (reconciler snapshot/state reads, caveats sidecar, tombstones, cache counters). Scope now covers product, scripts and tests, with an AST guard instead of ruff."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795260179147206001,"uuid":"bb6927e3-470b-4b5e-b183-cd572a6a4aa6"}